[h2]Map Marker[/h2]
Draws units, vehicles and their directions on the map and GPS, and on supported spectator maps. In multiplayer the server sends position updates in batches and the client moves the icons between updates.

The server can show all sides in play or only while spectating, show friendly group members, or limit the overlay to the unit you are viewing. Names can appear next to icons, on hover, or be disabled. Players can hide the overlay in the Client tab.

[h2]How to enable it[/h2]
In Eden, place the [b]Map Marker[/b] module to use it in that scenario. Enable it without an Eden module through [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=450814997]CBA_A3[/url]. Open [b]Addon Options → Map Marker[/b], check [b]Enable Map Marker[/b] and restart the mission. In multiplayer, use the Server tab.

